# expect: Usage: sum [numbers...] [options]
# expect: .
# expect:   --scale <n>    How much each number counts (default: 1.0)
# expect:   --limit <n>
# expect:   <numbers>...   The numbers to add
# expect:   --help         Show this help
# expect: A tool with commands.
# expect: .
